#: manual/api/binary_checked.md:1
msgid "binary_checked API"
msgstr ""

#: manual/api/binary_checked.md:5
msgid "`binary_checked` provides `BinaryChecked`, a closed wrapper around `Result[Binary, ArithmeticError]`. Every operation takes and returns a `BinaryChecked`, applies the corresponding [`binary`](binary.md) operation when all operands are successes, and otherwise passes on the first error without running the operation. The wrapper keeps no IEEE flags: the checked operations turn the invalid operation and divideByZero exceptions into errors, and the arithmetic `_ctx` methods drop them. The [tutorial](../tutorial/binary_checked.md) builds pipelines step by step; the [design page](../design/binary_checked.md) models the wrapper as the error monad and proves the composition laws it relies on."
msgstr ""

