msgid "Add the wrapper and the packages whose types appear in its signatures to your `moon.pkg`:"
msgstr ""

#: manual/api/binary_checked.md:30
msgid "The examples call the packages as `@binary_checked.`, `@binary.`, `@def.` and `@lf_arith.` (`Luna-Flow/arithmetic`, printed as `@arithmetic` in the interface). They print a result with this helper:"
msgstr ""

#: manual/api/binary_checked.md:44
msgid "`Binary::to_string` prints the exact value as `coefficient p exponent`, so `3p-1` is $3 \\cdot 2^{-1} = 1.5$."
msgstr ""

