#: manual/api/binary_checked.md:182
msgid "`with_precision(p, mode)` rounds to $p$ bits in direction `mode` with an unbounded exponent, and aborts for $p$ outside `1..=binary_precision_max`; `ulp` is the unit in the last place at the value's precision (NaN for non-finite values)."
