#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:602
msgid "`basic_default` is the basic default context of the specification: precision 9, round-half-up, and every trap enabled except inexact, rounded and subnormal (GDA 1.70, page 16 (Default contexts)). The library also leaves the lost-digits trap off, because Appendix A says that the Lost digits condition should be set to 0 in default contexts (GDA 1.70, page 56 (Appendix A, The X3.274 subset)). It sets `extended=false` for this context (the X3.274 subset of Appendix A), which the definition of the basic default context in GDA 1.70 does not set."
