#: manual/api/decimal_gda.md:1407
msgid "The selected operand is then rounded to the context as by `plus`, except that in an extended context a zero keeps its sign: `max(-0, -0)` is `-0` for every rounding algorithm, while `plus(-0)` is `0` unless the rounding is `Floor`."
