#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:155
msgid "Support is decided from the operation name before any operand is read, so `nums2interval 1.0 2.0`, `rootn [1.0,8.0] 3` and `rsqrt [1.0,4.0]` are unsupported and do not count against `RunSummary::success`."
