#: manual/api/frontend/itl_expr.md:200
msgid "These methods return the case id, the disposition, whether the case passed, and a message: empty on success, `\"expected E, got A\"` on a mismatch (intervals printed by `DecoratedInterval::to_string`; `\"output N: expected E, got A; \"` for each wrong result of `mulRev`, `mulRevTen`, `mulRevToPair`, `powRev1`, `powRev2`, `atan2Rev1`, `atan2Rev2`), and a short reason or the offending text otherwise."
