#: manual/design/decimal.md:1488
msgid "guarantee that elementary-function certification succeeds: after the refinement limit of the context (twelve by default, `with_refinement_limit`; the last steps work with very wide numbers and can take a long time) it reports `CertificationFailure` (`try_*_ctx`) or NaN with `not_computed` (`*_ctx`);"
