#: manual/tutorial/def.md:208
msgid "`with_precision` reports no flags and ignores context exponent limits. A `Binary` still overflows at its implementation range of about $2^{\\pm 2^{30}}$. When rounding must be observed, use the `*_ctx` operations of the concrete package."
