msgstr ""

#: manual/tutorial/differential/interval_mpfr.md:20
msgid "The script writes the rows, computes the oracle in Python integers (every arithmetic row, nothing but CPython), builds `tools/interval_mpfr_oracle.c` and computes the MPFR oracle when the MPFR and GMP headers are found, checks that the two agree, runs the test of this package on native in release mode against each, and prints which oracles ran with their row counts, the rows not checked, and the verdict. The exit status is 0 when no row differs except the rows listed in `tools/interval_diff_known.txt`, and 1 otherwise. `--no-mpfr` runs the integer oracle only (the rows that only MPFR decides, `exp` and `ln`, are reported as not checked); `--require-mpfr` makes a missing MPFR an error."
msgstr ""

