msgid "Read the output"
msgstr ""

#: manual/tutorial/differential/interval_mpfr.md:34
msgid "The first table counts, per class, operation and precision, the rows and how many reached an overflow, a subnormal result, a subnormal operand or an underflow to zero according to the oracle's flags. `INTERVALDIFF_FAIL id op size class expected LO HI got LO HI` is a row whose bounds differ; the texts are canonical (`0b<odd integer>p<exponent>`, `inf`, `-inf`, `0`). Take the id to `inputs.txt` in the output directory (`.tmp/interval_diff`) for the operands."
