msgid "Comparisons"
msgstr ""

#: manual/tutorial/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:138
msgid "The comparison functions expect `0` or `1`. The signaling predicates (`eq_signaling`, `le`, `lt`) raise invalid for any NaN operand; the quiet ones (`eq`, `le_quiet`, `lt_quiet`) only for signaling NaNs:"
msgstr ""

#: manual/tutorial/frontend/testfloat_expr.md:166
