#: manual/verification.md:947
msgid "Correctly rounded in every rounding direction (certified enclosures refined until the rounding is unique). When the refinement budget is exhausted `try_*_ctx` returns `Err` and the plain form returns NaN; for decimal contexts with a precision or an exponent bound beyond 999,999 in magnitude the functions return NaN with `not_computed`."
